{"id":"vod_sn_36173","vodId":"36173","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"天使的心跳","name_cn":"天使的心跳","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/5e524eda29a93abd4eee124a38437d39.jpg"},"summary":"音无结弦（神谷浩史 配音）死后来到了死后的世界。醒来后发现在一座学校里，一名叫仲村由里（樱井浩美 配音）的女孩让他加入“无法容忍死掉战线”组织，简称SSS。他们的任务就是要和敌人——神的代表学生会长天使立华奏（花泽香菜 配音）作战。由里是这条战线的领袖，只要反抗天使就能继续存在，消灭天使就能获得世界。还没恢复记忆的音无只好答应加入她们的组织，但是他发现天使刀枪不入，他们都是不会受伤和死亡的。所谓敌人和战斗都是针对天使立华奏一个人的。音无还没恢复记忆，他不清楚这样的行为是不是正当的。真相慢慢被揭穿，年轻的生命们早早夭折，到底是神的恶意玩笑还是另有安排......","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:40:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/aZke99Ziui1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7mEGwQKNca1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/rqjNN9KRtD1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/R2MENXUn2h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/gDjS66bjwC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/MfszCAR7cv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7zqj7yMeQL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TFmnkraBjs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jF2U2MMnzq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/mUPVgYqs8d1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/nnxuQfbAdA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/gS9fVvAKSR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/xrYumv98fb1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:25.908Z"}